              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkaaga Haruni agösoha ahasë ahahoreeru, asuare ikiguchi ki igikubha këyö kiö öbhohökania kinyamërë amariina ga ibhiaro bhia abhaana bha Isiraeri; kögökora igo, uni ÖMÖNENE tëndabhaëbhe hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
